<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz said it downgraded Salomon Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- reduced earnings estimate to $5.50 per share from $7 for 1997 and to $6.25 from $7.50 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- also, Brown Brothers said analyst Raphael Soifer cut the 1997 estimate to $5.75 from $6.10, and maintained the 1998 estimate of $5.60.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/8 to 52-1/4.</p>
</text>
